{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tkem/cachetools/compare/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477...0caa3e89cc75ba0f73a134bbb2d622f0dae2aee5", "html_url": "https://github.com/tkem/cachetools/compare/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477...0caa3e89cc75ba0f73a134bbb2d622f0dae2aee5", "permalink_url": "https://github.com/tkem/cachetools/compare/tkem:4296bbd...tkem:0caa3e8", "diff_url": "https://github.com/tkem/cachetools/compare/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477...0caa3e89cc75ba0f73a134bbb2d622f0dae2aee5.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/tkem/cachetools/compare/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477...0caa3e89cc75ba0f73a134bbb2d622f0dae2aee5.patch", "base_commit": {"sha": "4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477", "node_id": "C_kwDOARLDB9oAKDQyOTZiYmRlMmJlMTI4MzQxYjE3MTI2ZTQzYTA2MjcxMjU5YWU0Nzc", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Sanjay Santhanam", "email": "51058514+Sanjays2402@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-07-30T15:26:59Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-07-30T15:26:59Z"}, "message": "Fix #405: Fix Cache.__setitem__ over-evicting when growing an existing key\n\n* Fix Cache.__setitem__ over-evicting when growing an existing key\n\nWhen getsizeof is set and an existing key's value grows, __currsize\nalready includes that key's old size, so reserving the full new size\ndouble-counts it and evicts an unrelated entry even though the updated\ncache would still fit within maxsize.\n\nReserve only the size delta instead, and recompute the reservation as a\nfull insert if popitem() happens to evict the key being updated.\n\nAdds a regression test covering all cache types.\n\nCloses #405\n\n* Address review: drop changelog entry, split setitem branches\n\nUse separate insert/replace branches in Cache.__setitem__ so the\ninsert path does not re-check key presence on every eviction, and\nonly the replace path re-derives diffsize after popitem.\n\nKeep test keys aligned with their values and add replace cases for\nsame-size and smaller values.", "tree": {"sha": "63fe77ae20727762bda28a3d2094d7fbea16732e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tkem/cachetools/git/trees/63fe77ae20727762bda28a3d2094d7fbea16732e"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tkem/cachetools/git/commits/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqa21DCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA23IQAHgjpVmBSLb6Bn6lvcpAIO3U\nx6/DKq4PZRoG0XvovioxT4diOWZronc+m6otFEXsj2l/lfLvreIQAmrwWE+LqO4D\nIsIOYoOeUKR0w5iIC6VQlRdf8B0Y8XfQk7Tq/i96yN45Q/LtcAyJqlAJwd32GqiD\nAevjPc02v4Tqhfs6xwcFmcBuFaA3kJZ4/2gKCutb5Rbi4pHsrZYmDdMTe3xr71y4\nMkc/0isquliRZKx6iaU8G9bLXp7/gl/B+fgrKGCv47atNID21KJztzgCkiFeehFP\nz6wD5NQqO4FYvQzyhZ/WxdSwpTK9ycafjWp8v/yI9/4YYdjbsDIWWrW/hjhUWQTv\nXrGQmdQ5FjEnbwMqErtnSD2tvmUsYZY99H2j8YAP5GN082bMtGfgqxdOWdfhkU2G\n7QBjgy6ED/Thb+8lkLlbe5ThHMEKpidi9KwvTgouXGkHpW1uxzdlZUX3vN95dygd\nyCdbJQHWQUpkl6RoRqL1TE2Fo+Utzt7KvgCFxyD4fpQTa12mwAA+dLr+tX0KXYXS\nfT54FgObYQcYhyIWFqDxqboDa34BJqkXVUodaQ7AF55T2RDk+kl0zDiIbI+LXP+N\nwnyf/mC1bNaM8LXphnlOLlDFV7f8scfk4fvvIji4vlxcPUMz308lTjtPFVuKBbBD\nCiF5ib4ZRJrb6nEPeSDy\n=/L3Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 63fe77ae20727762bda28a3d2094d7fbea16732e\nparent 13bb86a55e36e501cf0b3e4c35db516ed9409fd7\nauthor Sanjay Santhanam <51058514+Sanjays2402@users.noreply.github.com> 1785425219 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785425219 +0200\n\nFix #405: Fix Cache.__setitem__ over-evicting when growing an existing key\n\n* Fix Cache.__setitem__ over-evicting when growing an existing key\n\nWhen getsizeof is set and an existing key's value grows, __currsize\nalready includes that key's old size, so reserving the full new size\ndouble-counts it and evicts an unrelated entry even though the updated\ncache would still fit within maxsize.\n\nReserve only the size delta instead, and recompute the reservation as a\nfull insert if popitem() happens to evict the key being updated.\n\nAdds a regression test covering all cache types.\n\nCloses #405\n\n* Address review: drop changelog entry, split setitem branches\n\nUse separate insert/replace branches in Cache.__setitem__ so the\ninsert path does not re-check key presence on every eviction, and\nonly the replace path re-derives diffsize after popitem.\n\nKeep test keys aligned with their values and add replace cases for\nsame-size and smaller values.", "verified_at": "2026-07-30T15:27:00Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tkem/cachetools/commits/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477", "html_url": "https://github.com/tkem/cachetools/commit/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tkem/cachetools/commits/4296bbde2be128341b17126e43a06271259ae477/comments", "author": {"login": "Sanjays2402", "id": 51058514, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDU4NTE0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51058514?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402", "html_url": "https://github.com/Sanjays2402", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Sanjays2402/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_i